  "_casting_stat_README": [
    "VERIFIED (eqltools.com/attributes, client-mined): each class derives its mana pool",
    "from its own casting stat, and your pool is the sum of your two highest classes —",
    "the third is dropped. So a third caster adds no mana. The pool formula itself is",
    "unpublished, which is why the planner shows the casting stat but no mana number."
  ],
